<title>USA: U.S. brass mill shipments higher in January.</title>
<headline>U.S. brass mill shipments higher in January.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. brass mill shipments in January rose to 227,313,000 pounds, up from 177,867,000 pounds shipped in December, the American Bureau of Metal Statistics reported.</p>
<p>Brass mill receipts in January totaled 104,817,000 pounds compared to 72,522,000 pounds in December.</p>
<p>Inventory at the end of January was 144,939,000 pounds, up from 129,723,000 pounds at the end of December.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
